ok - a single transient stale pane_current_path read is not accepted as the worktree
ok - an abort leaves a leased slot holding uncommitted work and its lease untouched
ok - an already-settled pane is accepted on its first read
ok - a transient primary-checkout pane read is not accepted as the worktree
ok - a pane stuck on the primary checkout fails loudly at the deadline and returns its lease
# all fm-spawn-worktree-settle tests passed
